still a card-carrying lunatic.

825
00:43:22,600 --> 00:43:24,267
你只要敢对它有一丝放肆，
You take one liberty with it,

826
00:43:24,300 --> 00:43:26,233
信我一句，
and trust me on this,

827
00:43:26,267 --> 00:43:28,067
你就死定了。
you are going down.

828
00:43:31,233 --> 00:43:34,200
瞧吧，刚一进弯，
咱们就开始倒着开了。
There we go, into the bend
and we're going backwards.

829
00:43:43,067 --> 00:43:44,733
简直是个祸害。
A liability.

830
00:43:45,967 --> 00:43:47,500
所以，
So,

831
00:43:47,533 --> 00:43:51,533
它骨子里还是辆
用来显摆、而不是用来开的车。
it's still really
a car for show-offs
and not driving.

832
00:43:51,567 --> 00:43:54,067
它算是半吊子。
你看，问题在于，
It's kind of halfway.
You see, the thing is,

833
00:43:54,067 --> 00:43:57,733
如果你开的是普通超跑，
开上赛道去探寻极限，
if you were in a supercar
and you go out there,
and reach the limit,

834
00:43:57,767 --> 00:44:00,100
你知道的，抓地力极限，它会开始侧滑，
you know, the limit of grip,
it will start to slide

835
00:44:00,133 --> 00:44:01,867
而你是能控住漂移的。
and you can hold that slide.

836
00:44:01,900 --> 00:44:04,233
反正在机场跑道上，滑了也无所谓。
Because you're on an airfield,
it doesn't matter.

837
00:44:04,267 --> 00:44:07,400
但这车是四驱，抓地力大得惊人，
源源不断，
This four-wheel drive, so
you've got tons of grip,
tons and tons,

838
00:44:07,433 --> 00:44:09,433
可一旦到了极限，瞬间就失控了。
and then when you get
to the limit, it's off.

839
00:44:09,467 --> 00:44:12,467
不知道为什么，这套四驱系统蠢得要死，
而且它直接……
It's a really dim-witted
four-wheel drive system
somehow, and it just...

840
00:44:12,500 --> 00:44:14,333
你根本没法把它逼过极限。
You cannot push it
beyond the limit.

841
00:44:14,367 --> 00:44:17,433
-你根本没法把它开到极限。
-甚至连极限的边都不能碰。
-You can't drive it
to the limit.
-Or anywhere near the limit.

842
00:44:17,467 --> 00:44:21,433
只要敢开过头1%，
下场就是必死无疑？
The punishment for
overdoing it by 1%
is certain death?

843
00:44:21,467 --> 00:44:24,833
一点没错。
不过万幸的是……
Absolutely.
Happily, however...

844
00:44:24,867 --> 00:44:29,500
我们团队里有个人，
