This is it. This is where
he can unleash
that fearsome firepower.

864
00:45:32,467 --> 00:45:34,600
冲到轮胎减速弯这边了。
Coming down into
the tyres here.

865
00:45:34,633 --> 00:45:37,100
太快了，
连摄像机都被气流带晃了。
That is quick.
Even moving the camera.

866
00:45:37,133 --> 00:45:38,733
还剩最后两个弯。
Two corners left.

867
00:45:38,767 --> 00:45:41,700
一把切进去，
现在死死咬在
抓地力的极限边缘。
He trucks it in,
right on the limit
of grip now.

868
00:45:41,733 --> 00:45:43,667
全速杀向甘邦弯，切入！
Belts up to Gambon,
turning in.

869
00:45:43,700 --> 00:45:46,833
瞧瞧那个！牢牢按住车尾，冲线！
Look at that! Keeping the tail
in check. And across the line!

870
00:45:51,100 --> 00:45:52,767
你觉得它排第几？
Where do you think it came?

871
00:45:52,800 --> 00:45:54,500
-第四。
-第四？
-Fourth.
-Fourth?

872
00:45:54,533 --> 00:45:56,367
才不是第四。
Not fourth.

873
00:45:56,400 --> 00:45:57,833
绝不是第四。
Not fourth.

874
00:45:57,867 --> 00:45:59,167
它排在……
It came...

875
00:46:01,400 --> 00:46:03,600
瞧瞧这个，
女士们先生们。
Look at that,
ladies and gentlemen.

876
00:46:03,633 --> 00:46:06,167
第二、第四、第六名。
Second, fourth, sixth place.

877
00:46:06,200 --> 00:46:10,133
1分19秒8，跟
Carrera GT成绩一模一样。
1.19.8. The same as
the Carrera GT.

878
00:46:10,167 --> 00:46:12,100
全榜第六快的车。
The sixth fastest car.

879
00:46:13,933 --> 00:46:15,667
那可是台顶级超跑啊。
That's a hypercar.

880
00:46:17,967 --> 00:46:22,067
言归正传，去年我们决定
自己种点汽油出来。
Now, last year, we decided
to grow our own petrol.

881
00:46:22,100 --> 00:46:25,567
在节目早些时候
