三台拖拉机
And earlier on in the show
you saw us testing
three tractors

882
00:46:25,600 --> 00:46:28,333
想选出哪一台
最能胜任接下来的活儿
to decide which one
would be best for the job.

883
00:46:28,367 --> 00:46:31,433
结果我们纠结半天选不出来
干脆三台全弄来了
And we couldn't decide,
so we took all three.

884
00:46:31,467 --> 00:46:33,333
没错 拖拉机是搞到了
Yes, we had the tractors,

885
00:46:33,367 --> 00:46:36,067
现在 该开始干农活了
and now it was time
to start farming.

886
00:46:37,467 --> 00:46:39,233
男声：这里是BBC广播四台
MAN: This is BBC Radio 4.

887
00:46:39,267 --> 00:46:41,333
现在播出的是
