就是我们要种植出
第一批Top Gear牌汽油的地方
where we'll be growing
our first crop
of Top Gear petrol.

891
00:46:49,600 --> 00:46:53,233
我们只有一天时间完成播种 但紧接着
We had just one day
to get it sown and immediately

