我们每人各分两根电线杆的宽度。
Each of us gets
two telegraph poles.

969
00:51:06,067 --> 00:51:09,333
太棒了！接下来就看谁能
以最快速度耕完。
Yes! Then we're gonna see
who can do their ploughing
the fastest.

970
00:51:09,367 --> 00:51:11,967
不，我们得比谁耕得最好。
No, we're going to see
who can do it the best.

971
00:51:12,067 --> 00:51:14,467
鉴于我们对耕地
And because we
don't know anything

972
00:51:14,500 --> 00:51:17,533
一窍不通，我们特意请了几位耕地裁判，
about ploughing, we've invited
some ploughing judges,

973
00:51:17,567 --> 00:51:19,567
专门评判耕地水平的那种。
who judge ploughing.

974
