-唐卡斯特。
-I used to live in Yorkshire.
Where about?
-I'm Doncaster.

981
00:51:38,767 --> 00:51:40,367
杰里米·克拉克森也是唐卡斯特人。
Jeremy Clarkson is from
Doncaster.

982
00:51:40,400 --> 00:51:43,833
他确实是。其实我跟他母亲熟得很。
He is from Doncaster.
In fact, I know his mother
very well.

983
00:51:43,867 --> 00:51:46,433
-是吗？
-而且他当年上学时我就认识他了。
-Do you?
-And I knew him
when he was in school.

984
00:51:46,467 --> 00:51:49,600
-那你挺喜欢他吧？
-我可没说喜欢他。这个嘛……
-So you like him?
-I wouldn't say I like him.
Well...

985
00:51:51,867 --> 00:51:54,767
哈蒙德：我们已准备好开耕。
HAMMOND: We were
ready to plough.

986
00:51:54,800 --> 00:51:56,467
克拉克森：来吧。
哈蒙德：我知道该怎么搞了。
CLARKSON: Here we go.
HAMMOND: I know what to do.

987
00:51:56,500 --> 00:51:58,700
裁判：三、二、一，出发！
MAN: Three, two, one. Go!

988
00:52:02,167 --> 00:52:04,500
我开耕了。走起！
I'm ploughing. Here we go!

989
00:52:06,633 --> 00:52:10,100
啊！一号差速锁，二号差速锁，
Ah! Difflock one,
difflock two,

990
