1005
00:52:57,267 --> 00:53:01,733
与此同时，理查德
终于开着他的星舰“进取犁号”出发了。
Meanwhile, Richard
had finally set off
in the Starship Enterplough.

1006
00:53:01,767 --> 00:53:04,167
但就在他试图调头的那一刻，
But the moment he tried
to turn round,

1007
