Seen the size of the bolts
I've sheared?

1014
00:53:18,667 --> 00:53:21,700
你把螺栓都扯断了？
（倒吸一口凉气）
You've sheared the bolts?
(GASPS)

1015
00:53:22,200 --> 00:53:24,067
而且还不止一根。
More than one.

1016
00:53:25,867 --> 00:53:28,900
克拉克森：詹姆斯的拖拉机搁浅了，
哈蒙德的直接趴窝了。
CLARKSON: With James's tractor
beached and Hammond's
broken.

1017
00:53:28,933 --> 00:53:30,167
抱歉啦。
Sorry.

1018
00:53:30,200 --> 00:53:32,867
我的车，成了唯一还能动的。
Mine, was the only one
still running.

1019
00:53:32,900 --> 00:53:35,967
现在是下午一点半，
坦白讲，我觉得我们
It's half past one
in the afternoon, and I,
frankly can't see us

1020
00:53:36,067 --> 00:53:37,800
要想把这活儿干完，
getting this done,

1021
00:53:38,367 --> 00:53:41,067
花上一星期都不够。
in a week.

1022
00:53:41,067 --> 00:53:44,600
如果我们想在今天日落前
把庄稼全都种下去，
If we were going to get
our crop planted by the end
of the day,

1023
