我就必须施展出
我的聪明才智了，
I was going to have to break
out my ingenuity

1024
00:53:48,267 --> 00:53:50,067
用一种耕地方法，
and use a method of ploughing

1025
00:53:50,067 --> 00:53:53,900
一种《阿彻一家》里绝对没人能想得到的法子。
they certainly wouldn't
think of on The Archers.

1026
