- 腌洋葱。
- 哈蒙德和梅：要。
-Pickled onions.
-HAMMOND AND MAY: Yes.

1043
00:54:50,067 --> 00:54:51,767
- 布兰斯顿腌菜酱。
- 苹果。
-Branston pickle.
-Apple.

1044
00:54:51,800 --> 00:54:53,500
- 一个苹果。
- 奶酪。
-An apple.
-Cheese.

1045
00:54:53,533 --> 00:54:56,333
奶酪，两种都买上。
我可不想待会儿跟他吵架。
Cheese, get all both sorts.
I don't want to have a row
with him.

1046
00:54:56,367 --> 00:54:58,633
- 生菜。
- 别买生菜，绝对不行！
-Lettuce.
-No, lettuce. No!

1047
00:54:58,667 --> 00:55:00,200
克拉克森：最终
我们做出了决定
CLARKSON: Eventually
we made a decision

