Blimey! 14th is a bit
of a sharp gear.
It really goes.

1051
00:55:18,933 --> 00:55:23,367
随着哈蒙德开着他那台24吨的“买菜代步车”
扑向最近的村庄，
With Hammond's 24-ton runabout
bearing down on
the nearest village,

1052
