-I'm doing my pre-cultivation
checks.

1065
00:56:10,067 --> 00:56:11,733
多谢指教，老农杰斯罗。
Thank you, Jethro.

1066
00:56:11,767 --> 00:56:14,500
我觉得这是我们拍节目以来，
I think this is
the first thing
we've ever filmed,

1067
00:56:14,533 --> 00:56:17,167
头一回只有我能搞定，而那两个家伙却不行。
where I can do it
and those two can't.

1068
00:56:20,100 --> 00:56:21,833
-（刮擦声）
- 啊！
-(SCRAPING)
-Ah!

1069
00:56:26,600 --> 00:56:28,500
我撞到电线杆了。
I've hit the telegraph pole.

1070
00:56:28,533 --> 00:56:31,833
詹姆斯，我现在求求你了，
赶紧
James, I'm begging you now,
to just

1071
00:56:31,867 --> 00:56:34,567
开着拖拉机进地里去松土吧。
drive a tractor into the field
and do cultivating.

1072
00:56:34,600 --> 00:56:37,933
（无线电）饶命啊，詹姆斯。
饶了我吧。
就这一次……
(OVER RADIO) Mercy, James.
Mercy.
Just for once...

1073
00:56:38,833 --> 00:56:42,567
好了。两根液压管，
顶连杆已挂好。
Right. Two hydraulic tubes,
top-link attached.

1074
00:56:43,833 --> 00:56:45,500
（喇叭长鸣）
