快点，拿个准主意，到底站哪一边。
Come on, come down. One side
of the fence or the other.

1077
00:56:53,333 --> 00:56:56,167
农夫午餐。
斯提尔顿还是切达。
斯提尔顿还是切达。
Ploughman's lunch.
Stilton or Cheddar.
Stilton or Cheddar.

1078
00:56:56,200 --> 00:56:58,667
斯提尔顿。
（鸣笛声）
Stilton.
(HONKING)

1079
00:56:58,700 --> 00:57:01,567
你看吧。
詹姆斯·梅纯粹是在胡说八道。
You see.
James May was talking rubbish.

1080
00:57:01,600 --> 00:57:04,967
农夫午餐就是……
噢，来了一辆大巴。
Ploughman's lunch is...
Oh, that's a bus.

1081
00:57:06,933 --> 00:57:09,833
哈蒙德：我感觉
当地人已经
忍无可忍了。
HAMMOND: I sensed that
the locals had
had enough.

1082
00:57:11,433 --> 00:57:13,867
（汽车鸣笛声）
(CARS HONKING)

1083
00:57:13,900 --> 00:57:17,200
不过在离开镇子前，
我得去加个油。
But before I left town,
I had to fill up with fuel.

1084
00:57:20,667 --> 00:57:23,500
克拉克森：回到田里，
詹姆斯终于过来了，
CLARKSON: Back at the field,
James finally joined me

1085
00:57:23,533 --> 00:57:25,800
我们俩一起搞定了
耕地工作。
and together we finished
the cultivating.

1086
