HAMMOND: And to add
insult to poverty,

1095
00:57:57,833 --> 00:58:01,767
等我回去时，
我买的农夫冷餐还被嫌弃了。
when I got back,
my ploughman's was snubbed.

1096
00:58:01,800 --> 00:58:04,067
-克拉克森：一条法式
脆皮长棍。
-嗯，真“英式传统”。
-CLARKSON: A crusty,
French loaf.
-Mmm. Traditional.

1097
